.TH DNSCACHE-CONF 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dnscache-conf \- create a dnscache service directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dnscache-conf
.I account log-account directory
.RI [ ip ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates an absolute daemontools-style service directory with root hints,
random seed, logging, and resolver environment.  The default address is
127.0.0.1.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dnscache (1)
